From c53c21cd4fb270ab75cc659807376efb6bb71202 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fran Bull <fran@tailscale.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 09:57:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feature/conn25: expire connector state

The connector struct holds a map of peer+transitIP -> destinationIP that
it uses for routing traffic. The client registers new entries in the map
over the peer API.

Stop the transitIPs map from growing indefinitely by expiring entries
after 1 hour.

Updates tailscale/corp#38261

Signed-off-by: Fran Bull <fran@tailscale.com>
---
 feature/conn25/conn25.go      | 125 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 feature/conn25/conn25_test.go | 101 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 211 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

